{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>剛於11月22日迎來44歲生日大關，新婚人妻蔡卓妍被經理人霍汶希在社交平台發文大爆三喜臨門，瞬間引爆全城瘋狂猜 …</p><p></p>\n<p>剛於11月22日迎來44歲生日大關，新婚人妻蔡卓妍被經理人霍汶希在社交平台發文大爆三喜臨門，瞬間引爆全城瘋狂猜測她造人成功。日前她特意穿上一襲金色貼身閃裙出席品牌活動，親自為大肚疑雲解畫。這位壽星女在現場大方公開神袐第三喜背後真正原因。</p>\n<h2>霍汶希爆料惹蔡卓妍造人成功疑雲</h2>\n<p>剛於11月22日踏入44歲生日大關，阿Sa今年榮升人妻後選擇低調慶祝，不過經理人霍汶希就在社交平台分享到她家中慶生大合照，當中一句留言瞬間成為全網焦點。霍汶希寫下「今日其實係三喜臨門呀」，加上照片中阿Sa與老公林俊賢以及父親同框現身，幸福滿瀉畫面隨即惹來外界瘋狂揣測她已經懷孕。為打破大肚傳聞，阿Sa在11月24日特意穿上金色貼身閃裙亮相品牌活動，毫無保留地展示極致平坦小腹。</p>\n<h2>蔡卓妍現身親口拆解三喜臨門真相</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海而來恭喜訊息，阿Sa在活動現場即時作出澄清，笑指經理人霍汶希語意不清造成今次美麗誤會。她向在場人士解釋：「Mani講到唔清唔楚，搞到大家都走嚟恭喜我！其實所謂『三喜』，第一係我生日、第二係今年結咗婚、第三係難得約到咁忙嘅Mani一齊食飯咋。」除了親自粉碎懷孕傳聞，她更提到同門好姊妹阿嬌鍾欣潼雖然正忙於綵排，依然十分有心地送上親筆祝福，令她相當感動：「平時大家都係用電話Send Message，但阿嬌竟然好Old School咁親筆寫生日卡畀我。」</p>\n<h2>拒絕跟隨容祖兒步伐加入管理層</h2>\n<p>近日另一單引起外界關注娛樂大事，就是同門師姐容祖兒與謝霆鋒雙雙獲委任加入管理董事局，祖兒更公開笑言打算成立康樂部請全公司員工去旅行。身為公司元老級功臣之一，阿Sa被問到有沒有計劃步祖兒後塵加入管理層時，反應極大並馬上耍手擰頭極速拒絕。她大笑自嘲無能為力，更發表一番打工仔宣言：「千祈唔好呀！我廢㗎，天生係員工命，做唔到管理層。」對於老友升職做容董，阿Sa表明舉腳贊成對方為大家謀取福利。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚新婚人妻狀態大勇極具仙氣</h2>\n<p>阿Sa親自拆解三喜臨門真相後，大批粉絲隨即湧入社交平台留言送上生日祝福，並對她婚後首個生日展現完美狀態感到驚喜。不少網民表示「阿Sa結完婚依然咁有少女味，條貼身裙完全無多餘脂肪」，也有人針對她拒絕做高層搞笑回應「天生員工命呢句真係好中肯，最緊要有得跟住容董去旅行」。對於好姊妹阿嬌親手寫生日卡舉動，亦有網民留言大讚「Twins真係神仙友誼，依家仲邊有人會親筆寫卡」。社交網絡上湧現大量對這位新婚人妻送上滿滿祝賀留言。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586522154347392_11945322736b0aba864a518.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡卓妍 霍汶希 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586522154347392_11945322736b0aba864a518.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586522290681532_21180371866b0aba87512e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡卓妍 霍汶希 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586522290681532_21180371866b0aba87512e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586522363056484_18144026636b0aba87ee5da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡卓妍 霍汶希 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586522363056484_18144026636b0aba87ee5da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/choisaaaa_1782447502_3927774643691353318_1248351663_8488363916a994d80861bc-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡卓妍 霍汶希 （圖片來源：IG@choisaaaa）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/choisaaaa_1782447502_3927774643691353318_1248351663_8488363916a994d80861bc-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@choisaaaa）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/choisaaaa_1775113715_3866254914040681468_1248351663_749093626a994d7e8c0d7-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡卓妍 霍汶希 （圖片來源：IG@choisaaaa）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/choisaaaa_1775113715_3866254914040681468_1248351663_749093626a994d7e8c0d7-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@choisaaaa）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/choisaaaa_1787369352_3969062992050205217_1248351663_6822095966a994d86e8871-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡卓妍 霍汶希 （圖片來源：IG@choisaaaa）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/choisaaaa_1787369352_3969062992050205217_1248351663_6822095966a994d86e8871-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@choisaaaa）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%ae%b9%e7%a5%96%e5%85%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%8d%93%e5%a6%8d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡卓妍</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9c%8d%e6%b1%b6%e5%b8%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">霍汶希</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB、IG@choisaaaa資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3551662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:38:34.318799+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1489,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:27:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:52:26.175907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:32:10.369216+00:00","content_hash":"24a34b12ca1468d1ed4a06495ae4dd39a02e91e47343708a8e6404a45e93c050","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}